  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'>'<p>Royal in comfort and style, the Nike Zoom Vomero 5 lets you carve a new lane for yourself. Featuring a richly layered design with textile, leather, and plastic accents, these cool silhouettes take your sneaker game up a notch. The snappy and responsive Air Zoom unit keeps you feeling ultra-light on your feet and offers a smooth ride. Additionally, the plastic caging on the side lets you navigate through urban landscapes with stability and support. Your go-to for complexity, depth, and easy style, the Nike Zoom Vomero 5 helps you steal the show effortlessly.</p> <p><strong>Nike Zoom Vomero 5 features: </strong></p> <ul> <li>Real and synthetic leather upper adds durability.</li> <li>Mesh panels and ventilation ports on the heel provide a light feel and breathability.</li> <li>Reflective details offer visibility in low-light conditions.</li> <li>Rubber outsole gives durable traction.</li> </ul> <p>*Not intended for use as Personal Protective Equipment (PPE).</p><hr /><p>Long days on your feet feel easier when comfort and style show up in equal measure. The Nike Zoom Vomero 5 blends a breathable, richly layered upper with responsive Air Zoom cushioning and supportive side caging for a smooth, stable ride that works for city commutes, daily walks, and everyday wear.</p><ul><li>Real and synthetic leather upper adds durability.</li><li>Mesh panels and heel ventilation ports help keep the feel light and breathable.</li><li>Reflective details provide standout visibility in low-light conditions.</li><li>Rubber outsole delivers durable traction.</li></ul>  <p><strong>Size &amp; Fit Guidance</strong></p> <p>For the best fit, we recommend choosing your usual size for most wearers. If you prefer a little more room in the toe box or have wider feet, going up half a size may feel more comfortable.</p>  <p><strong>Best For</strong></p> <p>Best for all-day casual wear, walking, commuting, and everyday outfits that need comfort with a sporty edge.</p>  <p><strong>Styling &amp; Versatility</strong></p> <p>The Zoom Vomero 5 brings early-2000s running style into your daily rotation with layered textures, sleek lines, and a tech-driven look that stands out without being hard to wear. Reviewers love how easily it pairs with leggings, jeans, shorts, and more, making it an easy choice from errands to off-duty plans.</p>  <p><strong>Break-In &amp; Durability</strong></p> <p>Most reviewers say the comfort shows up right away, with little to no break-in needed, while some note it feels even better after a few wears. The layered build and rubber outsole make it a dependable option for frequent everyday use.</p>  <p><strong>Care &amp; Maintenance</strong></p> <p>To help preserve the look of the mixed-material upper, gentle spot cleaning is the best approach. Letting the shoes air dry after wear can also help keep them looking fresh and feeling ready for the next outing.</p>\"</div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike Zoom Vomero 5 - Women's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Women's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Dark Team Red/Black/Burgundy Crush</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Width</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Width - B - Medium</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Material</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Breathable mesh upper with durable synthetic overlays and rubber traction outsole</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12